        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana UFBS138, Modern Square Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana's solid brass 1-3/8\" tall modern square door stop is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. It is easy to install with the included mounting hardware. This is one the quickest floor mounted door stops to install because the ring goes all the way around the bumper, allowing you to install it just about anywhere on the floor for door contact. Drill one hole and it's done. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door lever hits the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the wall and door lever as well. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-UFBS138_size.gif?v=1704354618\" width\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana UFBS138 Modern Square Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIs this Door Stopper to small for your application? Also Available Larger <a href=\"/products/oversized-universal-floor-bumper-deltana-ufbs25\">2-1/2\" Modern Square Door Stop</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana UFBS138 Modern Square Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 1-3/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Height of Rubber from Floor: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hardware: #12 x 1-1/2\" screw plus plastic anchor</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Color: Black</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/UFBS138.pdf?v=1691095377\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana UFBS138 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside. \r\n<br>\r\nDeltana also offers a <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-door-stop-bumper-for-ufbs138-deltana-rubbertip-ufbs\">Replacement Rubber Bumper</a> available in either black or gray.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Modern Square Door Stop",
                "description": "Deltana's UFBS138 solid brass 1-3/8 inch tall modern square door stop is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. It is easy to install with the included mounting hardware. Available in 8 great finishes. ",
